# E-Commerce Platform Implementation Tasks (TODO.tsk)
===============================================================================
Target Stack: Python | Django | Django REST Framework | MySQL | Redis | Kafka | Microservices Architecture
Generated On: 2026-09-11
===============================================================================

CURRENT STATE SUMMARY & GAP ANALYSIS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[!] User Service:
    - Current: Custom User model, JWT Authentication (SimpleJWT access & refresh tokens, token blacklisting on logout), User Registration API with password validation/hashing, User Login API, User Profile retrieval (`GET /api/auth/me/`), and basic CRUD views.
    - Missing: Profile Update (`PATCH /api/v1/users/me/`), Password Change & Recovery flow (`change-password`, `forgot-password`, `reset-password`), Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) permission classes, and Unit/Integration tests.

[!] Product Service:
    - Current: Basic Product/Category models & basic CRUD views.
    - Missing: DRF Standard Pagination, FilterBackends (django-filter, SearchFilter, OrderingFilter), Query Optimization (select_related, prefetch_related, indexing), Redis Cache integration (Product list/detail caching, cache invalidation on update/delete).

[!] Razorpay Payment Service:
    - Current: Basic Razorpay client abstraction & initial checkout views.
    - Missing: Razorpay Webhook signature verification, transaction state machine (INITIATED -> PROCESSING -> SUCCESS / FAILED / REFUNDED), automatic Order status transitions upon payment events, Refund processing APIs.

[!] Kafka Event-Driven Notification Pipeline:
    - Current: Not implemented.
    - Missing: Kafka Producer for Order & Payment lifecycle events (OrderPlaced, PaymentSuccessful, PaymentFailed, OrderDelivered), Kafka Consumer service for real-time customer notifications (Email/SMS/Push notifications), Event Schema contracts.

[!] Microservices & Infrastructure Configuration:
    - Current: Monolithic Django app on SQLite, environment variables hardcoded.
    - Missing: Decoupled service boundaries / Modular apps, MySQL RDS/local DB setup, Redis cache configuration in Django settings, Kafka broker configuration & docker-compose for local microservices orchestration.

[!] Distributed Tracing & Correlation ID Tracking:
    - Current: Not implemented.
    - Missing: Request-level correlation ID middleware (`X-Correlation-ID`), contextvars context tracking, custom logging filter to attach correlation ID across all log records, Kafka message header propagation, and consumer-side correlation context restoration.

