3. RAZORPAY PAYMENT SERVICE & ORDER LIFECYCLE TRACKING
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- [ ] 3.1 Store `RAZORPAY_KEY_ID`, `RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET`, and `RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET` in environment variables (`python-dotenv` / `django-environ`).
