- [ ] 3.3 Implement Razorpay Order creation API (`POST /api/v1/payments/create-order/`) communicating with Razorpay SDK.
- [ ] 3.4 Implement Payment Verification API (`POST /api/v1/payments/verify/`) to verify cryptographic HMAC signatures.
- [ ] 3.5 Implement Razorpay Webhook Handler (`POST /api/v1/payments/webhook/`):
