      - [ ] Handle `payment.captured`, `payment.failed`, `order.paid`, `refund.processed`
      - [ ] Make webhook processing idempotent to handle retries safely
- [ ] 3.6 Synchronize Order Lifecycle state machine:
      - [ ] Transition Order status: PENDING -> PAID upon verified payment
      - [ ] Update Order `paid_amount`, `completed_at`, and stock reservations
- [ ] 3.7 Implement Refund API (`POST /api/v1/payments/refund/`) with Razorpay refund API.
- [ ] 3.8 Add Unit and Integration tests for Razorpay payment creation, verification, and webhook handlers.

