      - [ ] Topic: `payment-events` (`PaymentInitiated`, `PaymentSuccess`, `PaymentFailed`, `PaymentRefunded`)
      - [ ] Topic: `notification-events` (`SendEmail`, `SendSMS`, `SendPush`)
- [ ] 4.3 Implement Event Producer module (`utils/kafka_producer.py` / `events/producers/`):
