      - [ ] Store correlation ID in Python `contextvars` for thread-safe & async-safe execution context
      - [ ] Attach `X-Correlation-ID` header to all outgoing HTTP responses
- [ ] 6.2 Configure Django Structured Logging with Correlation ID:
